WEBVTT

00:49:29.121 --> 00:49:33.038
say that, again, who is we and what does
that have some asterisks on them?

00:49:33.704 --> 00:49:34.704
Sorry, go ahead.

00:49:34.788 --> 00:49:40.538
Well, that's if they could understand
what it means to not harm humanity,

00:49:41.579 --> 00:49:44.538
that there's a lot wrapped
up in that sentence.

00:49:44.538 --> 00:49:47.371
Because what's been so striking
to me about efforts

00:49:47.371 --> 00:49:50.538
so far is that they seem
to have been based on

00:49:50.538 --> 00:49:52.329
a very naive view of human nature.

00:49:52.663 --> 00:49:56.204
Go back to the sort of Facebook
and Twitter examples of, well,

00:49:56.246 --> 00:49:57.413
the engineers building some of

00:49:57.413 --> 00:50:02.079
the systems would say we've just designed
them around what humans want to do.